---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
import headshot from "../assets/images/jayme-headshot.jpg";
import river from "../assets/images/jayme-river.jpg";
---

<Layout
	title="About Jayme"
	description="Meet Jayme Coleman, LMT — a Fort Collins-based massage therapist and graduate of the Berkana Institute of Massage Therapy."
>
	<!-- Intro -->
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-24">
		<div class="grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
			<Image
				src={headshot}
				alt="Jayme Coleman, LMT, smiling outdoors against a warm adobe wall"
				width={900}
				height={1125}
				class="aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-md"
			/>
			<div>
				<p class="font-heading text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-rust uppercase">
					About Jayme
				</p>
				<h1 class="mt-4 font-heading text-4xl font-semibold text-brand-navy sm:text-5xl">
					I'm a massage therapist, and I believe your body deserves care.
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-6 font-body leading-relaxed text-brand-navy/80">
					I'm a massage therapist and a graduate of the Berkana Institute of Massage
					Therapy. I came to this work after 14 years at a desk, where I felt the toll poor
					body mechanics took on me, physically and mentally. That pushed me toward a path
					of wellness, and toward helping others reconnect with their own well-being.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-4 font-body leading-relaxed text-brand-navy/80">
					Our bodies carry us through this life, and it's easy to forget about them. Massage
					helps the body connect with itself again, and once that happens, real healing can
					start. For all the hard work your body does for you, it deserves to be cared for.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Mission & vision -->
	<section class="bg-brand-navy text-brand-cream">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-6 py-20 sm:py-24 md:grid-cols-2">
			<div>
				<h2 class="font-heading text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-orange uppercase">
					Mission
				</h2>
				<p class="mt-5 font-body text-xl leading-relaxed italic sm:text-2xl">
					Sacred Ground Bodywork exists to care for the bodies that carry us through life.
					Whether you build Colorado's hospitals or you're just getting through a long week,
					your body works hard for you, and it deserves care in return. I bring massage to
					my home studio in Fort Collins, to your door across northern Colorado and the
					Denver metro, and to construction sites, so the people who work hard get the care
					they've earned.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h2 class="font-heading text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-orange uppercase">
					Vision
				</h2>
				<p class="mt-5 font-body text-xl leading-relaxed italic sm:text-2xl">
					To be the massage therapist people in northern Colorado and the Denver metro trust
					with their care, whether they're booking a session for themselves or bringing it
					to a crew on the jobsite.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- A bit more / life outside work -->
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-24">
		<div class="grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
			<div class="order-2 md:order-1">
				<h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold text-brand-navy sm:text-4xl">
					A Bit More About Me
				</h2>
				<p class="mt-5 font-body leading-relaxed text-brand-navy/80">
					I'm a Colorado native living in Fort Collins. When I'm not working, you'll find me
					outside hiking, running, biking, or taking my dogs on wild adventures. My husband
					is a farmer (I adore him), and we both believe it's our job to care for each other
					and the earth.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-4 font-body leading-relaxed text-brand-navy/80">
					I once sold everything I owned to volunteer around the world for 18 months, and I
					make a mean sourdough. I love people, spontaneous adventures, and simplicity. Most
					of all, I love connecting with people and helping them live their best lives.
				</p>
				<Button href="/book" variant="secondary" class="mt-6">Book a Session</Button>
			</div>
			<Image
				src={river}
				alt="Jayme with a friend along a Colorado river, surrounded by autumn hills"
				width={1200}
				height={900}
				class="order-1 aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-md md:order-2"
			/>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
